#-------------
BUCKET
#-------------
Stats   - +1 Armor, +1 KB Resist, Break 5%
#-------------
Changes - Model, Stats
Change Notes - Updated the model to resemble PvZ's buckethead model.
Additionally, would be nice if you gave it +1 armor points and +1
knockback resistance, like the cone and football helmet. Optional.
#-------------


#-------------
BRICK HELMET
#-------------
Stats   - +2 Armor, +1 KB Resist, Break 2%
Bonus   - Limits vision, like a pumpkin!
#-------------
Changes - Craftable by placing 5 bricks in a helmet pattern.
Change Notes - This is essentially a worse version of the football
helmet. It's easy to craft, but that's acceptable because A) it can't
stack, and B) because iron economy lowkey doesn't matter.
This is meant to be the tankiest "basic" armor a zombie can wear.
That may change in the future.

Note: Crafting is optional. If not craftable, not the end of the world.
Make the spawn weight of this brick helmet 20% of the bucket helmet's.
#-------------

#-------------
SCREEN DOOR
#-------------
Stats   - N/A (block)
#-------------
Changes - Craftable by replacing the middle two wood planks of any door
recipe with iron nuggets. You could do this with 4 oak and 2 iron, or
4 spruce and 2 iron, or 4 birch and 2 iron, and so on. Screen door!
Change Notes - N/A

Note: Details about Door Zombies are in the door-specific folder.
#-------------
